flowchart LR
    classDef read fill:#e0f0ff,stroke:#2471a3,color:#000
    classDef write fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c0392b,color:#000
    classDef payment fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b7950b,color:#000
    classDef media fill:#e8f8f5,stroke:#117864,color:#000

    Client[Client guest or owner]
    Admin[Admin or merchant]
    Gateway[API Gateway with AuthN AuthZ and RateLimit]
    NotifSvc[Notification Service]

    SearchSvc[Search Service]:::read
    SearchIndex[(AWS Elasticsearch Search Index)]:::read
    PropertyReadSvc[Property Read Service]:::read
    PropertyCache[(Property Cache Redis)]:::read
    PropertyReplica[(Property DB Read Replica)]:::read

    BookingSvc[Booking Service]:::write
    RedisLock[(Redis Distributed Lock per property and night TTL bound to hold)]:::write
    BookingNightCal[(Booking Night Calendar Table)]:::write
    BookingDBPrimary[(Booking DB Primary)]:::write
    BookingDBReplica[(Booking DB Read Replica)]:::write
    BookingCache[(Booking Cache Redis)]:::write
    Reaper[Hold Expiry Reaper Job]:::write

    PaymentSvc[Payment Service]:::payment
    PaymentDB[(Payment DB)]:::payment
    ExtPay[External Payment Provider Paypal]:::payment

    PropertyWriteSvc[Property Write Service]:::write
    PropertyDBPrimary[(Property DB Primary)]:::write
    CDC[Debezium reads database WAL]
    IndexKafka[(Kafka CDC Topic)]
    IndexWorker[Search Index Sync Worker]
    BulkKafka[(Kafka Bulk Update Topic)]
    BulkWorker[Bulk Update Worker]

    MediaSvc[Media Upload Service]:::media
    S3[(AWS S3)]:::media
    Breaker[Chunk Breaker Service]:::media
    MediaKafka[(Kafka Media Topic)]:::media
    TranscodeMgr[Transcode Manager]:::media
    TranscodeWorkers[Transcode Worker Pool]:::media
    UploadWorker[Rendition Upload Worker]:::media
    CDN[CDN]:::media

    Client -->|GET /search or /property by id| Gateway
    Gateway --> SearchSvc
    SearchSvc -->|1 candidate ids by city price range and amenities| SearchIndex
    SearchSvc -->|2 filter out properties with a booked night in the date range| BookingNightCal
    SearchSvc -->|3 hydrate property details| PropertyCache
    PropertyCache -.cache miss.-> PropertyReplica

    Gateway --> PropertyReadSvc --> PropertyCache

    Client -->|POST /reserve for stay dates| Gateway --> BookingSvc
    BookingSvc -->|1 acquire one lock per night in range fail fast if any night is already locked| RedisLock
    BookingSvc -->|2 one transaction inserts a row for every night in range unique constraint rejects a taken night| BookingNightCal
    BookingSvc -->|3 insert booking status PENDING with expires_at| BookingDBPrimary
    BookingDBPrimary -->|replication| BookingDBReplica
    BookingSvc -->|invalidate on write| BookingCache
    Reaper -->|sweep expired PENDING bookings| BookingDBPrimary
    Reaper -->|delete the held night rows| BookingNightCal
    Reaper -->|release lock if still held| RedisLock
    RedisLock -.TTL auto expiry is the backstop if release is missed.-> Reaper

    Client -->|POST /pay with booking_id and idempotency_key| Gateway --> PaymentSvc
    PaymentSvc -->|charge| ExtPay
    ExtPay -->|webhook with payment status| PaymentSvc
    PaymentSvc -->|dedup by idempotency_key| PaymentDB
    PaymentSvc -->|confirm booking post payment| BookingSvc
    BookingSvc -->|BOOKED| BookingDBPrimary
    BookingSvc -->|release this stay's locks| RedisLock
    BookingSvc --> NotifSvc
    NotifSvc -->|SSE booking confirmed| Client

    PropertyDBPrimary --> CDC --> IndexKafka --> IndexWorker --> SearchIndex

    Admin -->|POST /properties bulk update| Gateway --> BulkWorker
    BulkWorker --> BulkKafka
    BulkKafka --> PropertyWriteSvc
    PropertyWriteSvc -->|chunked writes| PropertyDBPrimary
    PropertyWriteSvc -->|invalidate| PropertyCache

    Client -->|POST /upload| Gateway --> MediaSvc --> S3
    S3 --> Breaker --> MediaKafka --> TranscodeMgr --> TranscodeWorkers --> UploadWorker --> S3
    Client -->|GET /image| CDN --> S3
